  "text": "3.2 From my perspective, I can't imagine myself having these little creatures on me. It's quite disgusting, isn't it? As far as I'm concerned, if I had a bad accident, I'd want doctors to do whatever was necessary to help me recover. I think most people would, wouldn't they? I think most people would have the same negative reaction to this treatment that I would. In my opinion, there's very little about medicine that's pretty, is there? Yeah, but a living medical tool? To me, that's a bit too unpleasant. Well, it seems to me that until technology can develop something that does the job as well as leeches, perhaps some kind of robot, then this is an interesting and practical solution. Those are some interesting views. Thanks, everyone.",
